# Home Assistant terminology

Use the exact Home Assistant name when you help someone find a control. Use a short explanation when you help them understand it. Keep the names people gave their devices, and any ID they must copy, exactly as they are.

Start with the [A to Z Technical](style-guides/technical-a-to-z.html). These pages are the full lists behind it.

